  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks. Place capsicum and peeled & chopped pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Spread in a single layer and roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ac85919e219745f0517147/step-58377bec.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a medium saucepan over a medium\u0002high heat.\n• Add 1/2 the garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water, vegetable stock powder and risoni. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to medium and simmer, stirring occasionally, until the risoni is 'al dente' and the water is absorbed, 13-15 minutes. TIP: Add a splash more water if the risoni looks dry!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ac85919e219745f0517147/step-31589ee8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While risoni is cooking, roughly chop parsley.\n• In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat.\n• Cook panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients), stirring, until golden brown, 3 minutes. Add a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) and remaining garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Season and stir through the parsley. Set aside.\n• Cut the lemon into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ac85919e219745f0517147/step-443a00c0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Gently stir roasted veggies, baby spinach leaves, basil pesto, a squeeze of lemon juice and 1/2 the fetta cubes through the risoni. Season.\n• Divide roast pumpkin risoni between bowls. Sprinkle with garlic pangrattato and crumble over the remaining fetta cubes. Serve with any remaining lemon wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ac85919e219745f0517147/step-fea8d4f7.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
